%description:
The core network's nodes run IPv6 next to IPv4: the anchor (upf) and the base station
(gnb) have an IPv6 layer (hasIpv6). Their IPv6 runs Neighbor Discovery on every interface
of their network layer, which must not include the user-plane interfaces: the anchor's
N6 interface (dnPpp, no interface of its network layer) and the base station's cellular
NIC (whose Neighbor Discovery the base station discards, see CellularNicNdSink). The
simulation runs to its time limit without an error.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.upf.hasIpv6 = true
*.gnb.hasIpv6 = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 0
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Simulation time limit reached
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
